e_func' is defined but never used.","react/jsx-pascal-case","Imported JSX component Styled_component must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","JSXOpeningElement","usePascalOrSnakeCase","Imported JSX component Main_page must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","Imported JSX component Func_props must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Class_props must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","'useNavigate' is defined but never used.","Imported JSX component Image_state must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","jsx-a11y/heading-has-content","Headings must have content and the content must be accessible by a screen reader.","eqeqeq","Expected '!==' and instead saw '!='.","BinaryExpression","unexpected","Imported JSX component Btn_red must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Btn_blue must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Btn_green must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Btn_orange must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Props_btn must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"]